# Cross-generational mating: grandfather GF has a child W with Z, who is also the
# partner of his grandson GC. W is both an uncle of GC and a half sibling of GC's
# child GGC. The GF-Z couple spans two generations, which kindepth must reconcile.
CLAS	GF	0	0	1	1
CLAS	GM	0	0	2	1
CLAS	P	GF	GM	2	1
CLAS	S	0	0	1	1
CLAS	GC	S	P	1	1
CLAS	Z	0	0	2	1
CLAS	GGC	GC	Z	2	1
CLAS	W	GF	Z	1	2
